{"v":4,"catch":"做好準備，加快速度。以音速來場團隊賽車吧！","desc":"《Team Sonic Racing》結合了刺激街機遊戲與快節奏競速賽車遊戲中最精彩的元素。與好友在激烈緊湊的多人競速遊戲中一較高下，一同穿梭於眾多華麗繽紛的世界，還能組成隊伍通力合作，共享強化道具與加速衝刺效果。決定個人專屬的駕駛作風：3 種風格迥異的角色類型中任您挑選，還能解鎖足以扭轉局勢的車輛改裝選項，以符合您的駕駛作風。","publisher":"SEGA","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["競速","動作","運動"],"players":"單機 1–4 人 · 本機通訊 2–8 人 · 網路 2–12 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":12,"poff":4,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 6.5GB / Switch 6.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d3de4a563266601ddf8be1ce20238027c6c065cd7c0925285c45ade357c58cb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd24a66858871f3284d698f547eb1c3a02af38b664efe7725008eec5a1c01434.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/177719651cb9f280a8d195f5b85f28b2db3f1a3ca178a5c536c14c852995139f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25feccdf895a42e369b4dea66c370f5084e819cb0c1c59326f7f8f4a8b33f93d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/66ef399115735c36b368a6fda80c41318ca19a1a0cc2143ce6d307b6d0ba1c6b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f169a495e503eb57fe3c63a78f1138fe8ac8110ad7727a322b6afc1be770a2e.jpg"],"titleId":"010029d00b72a000","dlc":[],"vids":["fDinuDNX-IQ","0Cy2ENWQV10","WUbPBx9e9Xk"]}